      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Shadi Attieh, or Chadi Atie (Arabic: شادي عطية; born ٍSeptember 14, 1989 in Beirut, Lebanon), is a Lebanese professional footballer who plays as a left back for Shabab Al-Sahel. Attieh is not only known for his solid defense but also his attacking abilities. He is often referred to as the \"Lebanese Ashley Cole\".",
